n\n# **Siddha Seabrook by Siddha Group and Sejal Realty in Kandivali West**\n\n### **Siddha Seabrook by Siddha Group and Sejal Realty is one of the Tallest Luxurious **Residential**** **Tower in Kandivali West** near New Link Road\n\n**Siddha Seabrook Kandivali West** has 3 **towers**, with **G +7 + Amenities floor + 46 Residential floors – 54 storeys** and 505 **Flat** **units** to offer.\n\nSiddha Seabrook boasts spacious **1.5BHK-Smart**, **2BHK-Premium**, **3BHK-Premium** and **3BHK-Sky Garden** Homes (Flats). Here, you can enjoy the lavishness of luxury living, at an unmatched price\n\nSpread over an area of 1.75 acres Siddha Seabrook in Kandivali West is scheduled for **Possession Date** March 2023 and Siddha Seabrook is a **RERA**–**registered** **project** with registration number P51800008859\n\nThe entire project will be elevated on 7 levels of podium with 1st Habitual floor starting from 100 feet from the ground.\n\nSiddha Seabrook is graced with Sky Garden on every 5th Floor, which allows you to live amidst greenery and enjoy the magnificent view of the Mumbai skyline.\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n| BHK | Carpet Area (Sq.Ft) | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1.5 BHK Smart | 496 | [Click Here](https://ongoingproperties.in/inquiry-form/) |\n| 2 BHK Premium | 706 | [Click Here](https://ongoingproperties.in/inquiry-form/) |\n| 3 BHK Premium | 1,008 | [Click Here](https://ongoingproperties.in/inquiry-form/) |\n| 3 BHK Sky Garden | 1,258 | [Click Here](https://ongoingproperties.in/inquiry-form/) |\n\n## Address\n\n [Open on Google Maps](http://maps.google.com/?q=Siddha%20Seabrook,%20Kandivali,%20Shankar%20Pada,%20Kandivali%20West,%20Mumbai,%20Maharashtra)\n\n* **Address** Opp.Symphony Tower, New Link Rd, Laljipada Police Chowky, Amann Spring Bld Kandiwali West\n* **State/county** Maharashtra\n* **Zip/Postal Code** 400067\n* **Area** New Link Rd, Laljipada Police Chowky\n* **Country** India\n\n## Details\n\n* **Property ID:** SEABROOK\n* **Price:** Strat From