fully\n\nLikes\n\nSummary\n\nShare\n\n![](/Images/error-icon.png)\n![](/Images/error-icon.png)\n![](https://www.mouthshut.com/Images/COMMON/copy-clipboard.svg)\n\n# [Siddha Seabrook, Kandivali West, Mumbai](https://www.mouthshut.com/projects/siddha-seabrook-kandivali-west-mumbai-reviews-925926221) By [Siddha Group, Mumbai](https://www.mouthshut.com/builders-and-developers/siddha-group-mumbai-reviews-925901216)\n\n![Siddha Seabrook - Kandivali West - Mumbai Image](https://image3.mouthshut.com/images/realestate/banner/925926221s.jpeg)\n\n## Siddha Group - Mumbai\n\n## Project Details of Siddha Seabrook, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n## Edit Specification for Siddha Seabrook - Kandivali West - Mumbai\n\n### Overview\n\n### Units Details and Floor Plans\n\n| Configuration Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Base Price (Rs.) | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n\n### Home Loans\n\n![](../../Imageserverweb/dropdown-icon.svg)\n\n### Amenities\n\n![](../../Imageserverweb/dropdown-icon.svg)\n\n### Location and Highlights\n\n| LandMark | Distance (km) | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n## Location and Highlights\n\n![](/images/realestatemap.jpg)\n\nShiv Shankar Nagar, Link Road, Lalji Pada, Kandivali, Mumbai 400067, MH\n\n## Reviews on Siddha Seabrook, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nThis is one the most renowned apartments in mumbai\n\nThe staff behaviour is also exceptional and well trained faculty is available\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\nThis project was very good but the way they are treating buyers are different before purchase they will say different words after purchasing is their response is different\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\nI want to inform to investor please if you really want to safe your money then just stay away from this builder, I have seen many investor who also losses their money by investing in property. They only invest money in promotion but they never satisfy clients needed.\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\nYOUR RATING ON\n\nI can only guide investors and people buying flats to stay to be as far away from Lodha. Crores of Rupees are being spent on Marketing but they don't want to spend on client satisfaction. Quality of construction is poor and shoddy job is what you see when you take handover after years of delay. The only thing they are very efficient is in collecting Money from you.\n\nTheir policies are not Customer friendly. A lot of negative has been written about them on various platforms and I have experienced the careless attitude. Never again a Lodha flat. My personal view after investing and dealing with Top builders with my investments, STAY AWAY from this one. They don't care!\n\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\n## Siddha Seabrook, Kandivali West, Mumbai Photos\n\n![](../../APP_THEMES/images/category/Close - Dark.svg)\n![](../../APP_THEMES/images/category/Close - Dark.svg)\n![Real Estate Banner](/Images/Real_Estate_Footer_Banner_Icon.png)\n\n### MouthShut is the best platform to start your real estate search!\n\n### Real Estate Brands\n\n### Real Estate Builders under Mumbai\n\n### Real Estate Projects under Mumbai\n\nProducts Listed\n\nShopping Decisions Influenced\n\n### MouthShut for Brands\n\n### Review of the Day\n\n![Verified Member](/APP_THEMES/Default/IMAGES/verified-member-icon.png)\n\n### India's No.1 Rating & Review App\n\nDownload MouthShut Mobile App\n\n![](../../../ImageServerWeb/new home page icons/App.svg)\n![](/APP_THEMES/Images_New/Common/app-store-badge.svg)\n![](../../../ImageServerWeb/new home page icons/Play-Google.svg)\n![](/APP_THEMES/Images_New/Common/google-play-badge.svg)\n\n### Share your experience and win cash rewards!\n\n![recommended-by](/ImageServerWeb/new home page icons/Footer-Logos.svg)\n\nCopyright © 2000-2026 MouthShut.com. All rights reserved.Goldindia1\n\n![](/APP_THEMES/Images_New/Common/up-arrow.svg)\n![close]()\n\nFree MouthShut app saves money.\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n|  |  |\n\nOTP Verification\n\nVerify\n\nAn OTP has been sent to your email and mobile number.  \n Please enter OTP to verify the account.\n\nVerify\n\n[Didn't receive? Resend OTP](javascript:)\n\nOTP Verification\n\nVerify\n\nAn OTP has been sent to your email address. Please Enter OTP to verify your email address\n\nVerify\n\n[Didn't receive? Resend OTP](javascript:)","images":[]}],"failed_results":[{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/siddha-seabrook-kandivali-west-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-npxid-r271049","error":"Failed to fetch url"},{"url":"https://www.justdial.com/real-estate/project/Siddha-Seabrook-Mumbai/022PXX22.XX22.251007114128.R8U9/prid-622230a78f6aecd6830c65e7","error":"Failed to fetch url"}],"response_time":10.1,"request_id":"bf6e6782-4634-4d48-86f2-54f27d6469be"}